From 559ea9d47e6ce929932eea9e0adab4d1a798b2b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateful VP9 decoding

Add VP9 decoding with reference-slot management, probability updates
and HEVC-core output handling. Bound superframe index parsing by the
input payload and validate firmware dimensions against format limits.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
